@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Capability Module Definition
top to bottom direction

package "Source Shape" {
  rectangle "Module File Organization" as Files <<zoom>> [[organize_module_files/_mod_.puml]]
  rectangle "Rhai Asset Declaration" as Rhai <<zoom>> [[declare_rhai_assets/_mod_.puml]]
}

package "Native Shape" {
  rectangle "Native Backing Attachment" as Native <<zoom>> [[attach_native_backing/_mod_.puml]]
  rectangle "Module Shape Check" as Check
}

Files --> Rhai : classifies files for
Rhai --> Native : names required surfaces for
Native --> Check : proves kernel backing to
@enduml
